  storyText: "Nix's Echo\n\nIn the ruins, a recording: Nix, the netrunner who died in the bar. \"If you're hearing this - Mirage isn't dangerous. NetWatch knows. They're scared of what's beyond the Wall learning to talk to us.\"\n\n1. Keep going."
